[00:11.58] Taqdeer se kya gila Khuda ki marzi,
[00:17.20] Jo kuchh bhi hua, hua Khuda ki marzi,
[01:27.64] Amjad, har baat mein kahaantak kyon, kyon?
[01:27.64] Har kyon ki intahaa, Khuda ki marzi
[01:27.64] Duniya bhi ajab serai faani dekhi,
[01:31.98] Har cheez yahan ki aani jaani dekhi,
[01:45.12] Joo aake na jaae woh burhaapa dekha,
[01:49.36] Jo jaa ke na aae woh javaani dekhi,
[02:24.38] Har shai mein jamaal-e-dilruba ko dekha
[02:28.80] Har cheez men shaan-e kibriya ko dekha
[02:41.68] Makhluq mein khaliq ka nazr aaya jisko
[02:46.16] Us dekhne wale ne khuda ko dekha.
